# 2 Carat Lab Grown Marquise Diamond ({{year}}): Why Natural Costs 7x More

![Three 2 carat marquise cut lab grown diamonds held in jeweler tweezers against a grey backdrop with text overlay reading 2 Carat Lab Marquise Diamond Why Natural Costs 7x More as the DiamondCritics featured image](/images/2-carat-lab-marquise-diamond.jpg "2 Carat Lab Marquise Diamond Why Natural Costs 7x More")

## TL;DR — 2 Carat Lab Marquise in One Scroll

**A 2 carat lab grown marquise diamond starts at $2,212 in current certified inventory.** The natural D-VVS1 equivalent costs $15,000+. That is 6.8 times more for chemically identical carbon.

**The 3 key price points:**
- **Entry — IGI E-VVS1 Ideal at $2,212:** Cheapest true 2.00ct lab marquise in certified inventory. Eye-clean, brilliant white, 85% below natural D-VVS1.
- **VVS1 — IGI D-VVS1 Ideal at $2,403:** Top colour + near-flawless clarity. $191 more than entry. Natural equivalent: $15,000.
- **GCAL — GCAL D-VVS1 Ideal at $2,883:** The 8X grade guarantee. $480 more than IGI for the most defensible certificate at 2ct.

**Fractional arbitrage:** IGI 2.12ct E-VS1 at $1,890 — more carat weight, $342 less than the 2.00ct entry.

→ Entry pick: **[IGI 2ct E-VVS1 Ideal at $2,212](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/30348513?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)**
→ VVS1 pick: **[IGI 2ct D-VVS1 Ideal at $2,403](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29029139?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)**
→ GCAL pick: **[GCAL 2ct D-VVS1 Ideal at $2,883](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29639477?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)**

**Priority:** All three are certified, eye-clean, and cut for the marquise shape. The 7x natural premium is not a deal — it is the market structure at 2ct. See the full [marquise cut diamond guide](/marquise-cut-diamond) for shape fundamentals.

## Expert Summary

Certified 2ct lab grown marquise inventory runs from **$1,734** (fractional arbitrage) to **$5,291** (GCAL D-IF). The true 2.00ct range is $2,212–$4,409 for IGI and $2,883–$5,291 for GCAL. Natural 2ct D-VVS1 marquise costs $15,000+. The lab entry at $2,212 saves 85%.

I'm Farzana Hasan, a [GIA](https://www.gia.edu/)-certified diamond expert. At 2ct, the gap between lab and natural is not a preference — it is an arbitrage. You pay $2,212 for the same D-VVS1 grade that costs $15,000 in natural. The stones are identical chemically. The price difference is entirely origin. Full credentials at **[Diamond Critics](https://diamondcritics.com/about-farzana/)**. Our pillar **[marquise cut diamond guide](/marquise-cut-diamond)** covers every marquise topic in full.

This guide covers The 7x Natural Premium, The Fractional Size Arbitrage, and The GCAL 8X Premium. It includes grade-by-grade pricing and the complete $1,734–$5,291 inventory table. Setting pairing and the full lab vs natural comparison are covered in detail. All prices verified against live certified market data.

